F4. Object names that need quoting or renaming

sql
SELECT 'TABLE' kind, table_name name FROM user_tables
WHERE NOT REGEXP_LIKE(table_name, '^[A-Z][A-Z0-9_]*$')
UNION ALL
SELECT 'COLUMN', table_name || '.' || column_name FROM user_tab_columns
WHERE NOT REGEXP_LIKE(column_name, '^[A-Z][A-Z0-9_]*$');

Any rows here have lowercase or special characters. Since SQL Server will quote everything in brackets, they should still work, but I'll plan for them.
